|icon         = Wither.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Nasus}} ages the target enemy champion for a few seconds, gradually {{tip|slow|slowing}} and {{tip|cripple|crippling}} them over the duration.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Nasus''' ages the target enemy champion for 5 seconds, {{tip|slow|slowing}} them by 35% and {{tip|cripple|crippling}} them by{{ft|75% of that amount,|{{ap|35*0.75}}%,}}both increasing every second over the duration.
