|cast time    = {{fd|0.25}}
|cost         = 80
|costtype     = Mana
|targeting    = Unit
|affects      = Enemies
|spellshield  = True
|spelleffects =
|callforhelp  = true
|notes        = 
* ''Wither'' interrupts the target's {{tip|attack windup}} when it is first applied. {{bug}}
* If ''Wither's'' duration is affected by {{tip|Tenacity}} the effects will apply slower (negative tenacity percentage) or faster (positive tenacity percentage) so the maximum values are still reached when the modified duration ends.
