* Both {{tip|slow}} and {{tip|cripple}} from ''Wither'' are considered to be a single {{tip|debuff}}. {{bug|2}}
** Therefore, {{tip|slow immunity}} will prevent both, even without technical {{tip|cripple immunity}}.
